# Model + data artefacts go in via Git LFS — see .gitattributes.
# *.pt, *.pkl and *.npy are tracked by LFS, so they are NOT ignored.

# Except this one: 1.34 GB, over GitHub's 1 GB free LFS quota on its own,
# and nothing in the app loads it. See backend/app/ml/stage1.py.
stage2_model.pickle
